  Copyright The Qt Company Ltd. and other contributors
  Licence: GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0)
  https://www.qt.io/qt-for-python
  Neuro-Enhance uses PySide6 and Qt unmodified and links them dynamically.
  You may replace the Qt and PySide6 libraries with your own build. The
  source code of Qt is available from https://download.qt.io/ and
  https://code.qt.io/.

nvidia-ml-py (NVIDIA Management Library bindings)
  Copyright NVIDIA Corporation
  Licence: BSD 3-Clause
  https://pypi.org/project/nvidia-ml-py/

